</tbody></table>
</ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">At December 31, 2022, warrants for the purchase of <ix:nonFraction id="c834" contextRef="i_2022-12-31" unitRef="Share" name="blbx:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRightsVested" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">382,782</ix:nonFraction> shares were vested and warrants for the purchase of <ix:nonFraction id="c835" contextRef="i_2022-12-31" unitRef="Share" name="blbx:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRightsUnvested" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">55,554</ix:nonFraction> shares remained unvested. The Company expects to incur expenses for the unvested warrants totaling $<ix:nonFraction id="c836" contextRef="i_2022-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="blbx:WarrantNonvestedCostNotYetRecognizedAmount" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0">212,536</ix:nonFraction> as they vest.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>

<ix:exclude><div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
